<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18620" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαιΐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ΐδος, ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the Achaian land,</i> with or
			without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαῖα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.254
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.75
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνή</span>) <i>Achaian woman,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαιΐδες οὐκέτ᾽ Ἀχαιοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2.235
				</span></i>
			, etc.:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀχαιϊάς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				5.424
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
